{
  "key": 40604,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_TooSlow",
      "en_US": "Too slow!\r",
      "fr_FR": "Dépêche-toi un peu!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_LetsGetMoving",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: All right!\n",
        "Let’s get moving to Prof. Rowan’s lab.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Allez!\n",
        "En route pour le labo du\f",
        "Professeur Sorbier.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_IveGotAnIdea",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "What?\n",
        "Don’t go into the grass, right?\f",
        "No worries! No problem!\r",
        "It doesn’t matter that we don’t have\n",
        "any Pokémon.\r",
        "Trust me on this one.\n",
        "I’ve got an idea!\r",
        "Now listen. You know how wild Pokémon\n",
        "jump out when you go into tall grass?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Quoi?\n",
        "Evitons les hautes herbes?\f",
        "Pas de problème!\r",
        "Ce n’est pas grave que nous n’ayons\n",
        "pas de Pokémon.\r",
        "Fais-moi confiance.\n",
        "J’ai une idée!\r",
        "Ecoute. Tu sais que les Pokémon\n",
        "surgissent quand on marche dans\f",
        "les hautes herbes?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_JustKeepDashing",
      "en_US": [
        "So, what you do is, you scoot over to\n",
        "the next patch of grass before any\f",
        "wild Pokémon can appear!\r",
        "If we just keep dashing, we can get to\n",
        "Sandgem Town without running into\f",
        "wild Pokémon!\r",
        "OK, stick with me!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Il suffit de passer en trombe les zones\n",
        "herbeuses, avant même que les Pokémon\f",
        "aient le temps d’apparaître!\r",
        "Si on fait ça, on pourra atteindre\n",
        "Littorella sans encombre!\r",
        "Allez, suis-moi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_HereGoes",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, here goes!\r",
        "On your marks...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Allez, en route!\r",
        "A vos marques...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_HoldIt",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}Hold it!{SIZE 100}\r",
      "fr_FR": "{SIZE 200}Halte!{SIZE 100}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_YouHaveNoPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: You two don’t seem to have\n",
        "any Pokémon between you?\r",
        "Then, what is the meaning of going into\n",
        "the tall grass?!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Professeur: Vous ne semblez pas avoir\n",
        "de Pokémon, vous deux...\r",
        "On peut savoir ce que vous comptiez\n",
        "faire dans les hautes herbes?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_RivalEllipsis",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\n",
        "...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\n",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ProfessorEllipsis",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Professeur: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ThisIsProfRowan",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "This old guy...\r",
        "It’s Prof. Rowan, isn’t it?\n",
        "What’s he doing here...?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "Ce vieux bonhomme...\r",
        "C’est le Professeur Sorbier, pas vrai?\n",
        "Que fait-il ici...?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_HmmWhatToDo",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "They tried to go into the tall grass\n",
        "because they wanted Pokémon...\r",
        "Hmm...\n",
        "What to do...?\r",
        "Their world would surely change if\n",
        "they were to meet Pokémon...\r",
        "Is it right for me to put them on that\n",
        "path...?\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Professeur: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Ils sont allés dans les hautes herbes\n",
        "pour capturer des Pokémon...\r",
        "Hum...\n",
        "Que faire...?\r",
        "Leur vision du monde changerait du tout\n",
        "au tout s’ils croisaient des Pokémon...\r",
        "Est-ce la meilleure chose à faire...?\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_YouLovePokemonDoYou",
      "en_US": [
        "You two.\n",
        "You truly love Pokémon, do you?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous deux. Vous aimez vraiment\n",
        "les Pokémon, n’est-ce pas?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_YoureNotMakingSense",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Whoa, hold up!\n",
        "You’re not making any sense here!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hein, quoi?\n",
        "Mais qu’est-ce que tu racontes?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_IDidntCatchThat",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: Er-hem!\r",
        "I didn’t quite catch that, so I will\n",
        "ask you again.\r",
        "You two.\n",
        "You truly love Pokémon, do you?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Professeur: Ahem!\r",
        "Je n’ai pas bien entendu, alors je vais\n",
        "vous reposer la question.\r",
        "Vous deux. Vous aimez vraiment\n",
        "les Pokémon, n’est-ce pas?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ILovePokemonToo",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Me, too!\n",
        "I love Pokémon, too!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Moi aussi, j’aime\n",
        "les Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_IWillAskOnceAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: I will ask you once again.\r",
        "You two.\n",
        "You truly love Pokémon, do you?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Professeur: Je vais vous reposer la\n",
        "question.\r",
        "Vous deux. Vous aimez vraiment les\n",
        "Pokémon, n’est-ce pas?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_TheAnswerWillNeverChange",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What?!\n",
        "You can ask a hundred times!\f",
        "The answer will never change!\r",
        "We’ll both answer a hundred times,\n",
        "we love Pokémon!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Quoi?!\n",
        "Vous pouvez bien la poser cent fois!\f",
        "La réponse ne changera jamais!\r",
        "On répondra toujours qu’on aime\n",
        "les Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_RightPlayer",
      "en_US": "Right, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?",
      "fr_FR": "Pas vrai, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ThatJokesGettingOld",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\n",
        "That joke’s getting old!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\n",
        "Les plus courtes sont les meilleures!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ItWorriesMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: ...A pair of reckless kids\n",
        "who foolishly try to enter tall grass\f",
        "without Pokémon of their own...?\r",
        "It worries me what people like that\n",
        "would do with Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Professeur: Deux petits sots qui se\n",
        "promènent dans les hautes herbes alors\f",
        "qu’ils n’ont même pas de Pokémon...?\r",
        "Je m’inquiète de ce qu’ils pourraient\n",
        "faire s’ils en avaient.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_GiveAPokemonToMyFriend",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Uh...\n",
        "Well, I, uh...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Well, then forget about me, but give\n",
        "a Pokémon to my friend here!\r",
        "I mean, it was me who tried to go into\n",
        "the tall grass and all...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Euh...\n",
        "Eh bien, je, euh...\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Alors tant pis pour moi, mais donnez\n",
        "un Pokémon à mon acolyte!\r",
        "Vous savez, c’est moi qui ai insisté\n",
        "pour aller dans les hautes herbes...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_EntrustYouWithPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: !\r",
        "How big of you...\r",
        "Very well, then!\n",
        "I will entrust you two with Pokémon!\r",
        "I apologize for putting you through\n",
        "that exercise.\r",
        "However!\r",
        "You must promise me that you will never\n",
        "recklessly endanger yourselves again.\r",
        "Now, then...\r",
        "Hm?\n",
        "Now, where...?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Professeur: !\r",
        "Tu as beaucoup de cœur...\r",
        "Alors, c’est décidé!\n",
        "Je vais vous confier des Pokémon!\r",
        "Et je vous présente mes excuses pour\n",
        "vous avoir testés comme ça.\r",
        "Cependant, vous devez me promettre\n",
        "que vous ne prendrez plus de risques\f",
        "inutiles.\r",
        "Alors, voyons...\n",
        "Euh, qu’est-ce que j’en ai fait...?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_DawnYouLeftYourBriefcase",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Professor Rowan.\r",
        "You left your briefcase at the lake!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Professeur Sorbier.\r",
        "Vous aviez oublié votre mallette au lac!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_OhIsSomethingWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh?\n",
        "Is something wrong here?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh?\n",
        "Il y a un problème?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_LucasYouLeftYourBriefcase",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Professor Rowan!\r",
        "You left your briefcase behind at\n",
        "the lake.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Professeur Sorbier.\r",
        "Vous aviez oublié votre mallette au lac!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_IsSomethingWrong",
      "en_US": "Is something wrong here?\r",
      "fr_FR": "Il y a un problème?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_NiceWorkDawn",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Ah! There it is!\n",
        "Dawn, nice work.\r",
        "What I was about to do was to entrust\n",
        "these two with their own Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Ah! La voilà!\n",
        "Bien joué, Aurore.\r",
        "Je m’apprêtais à donner leurs propres\n",
        "Pokémon à ces deux jeunes.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_NiceWorkLucas",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Ah! There it is!\n",
        "Lucas, nice work.\r",
        "What I was about to do was to entrust\n",
        "these two with their own Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Ah! La voilà!\n",
        "Bien joué, Louka.\r",
        "Je m’apprêtais à donner leurs propres\n",
        "Pokémon à ces deux jeunes.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_DawnPokemonHardToReplace",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Pardon?!\r",
        "Those Pokémon are hard to replace.\n",
        "Are you sure about giving them away?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Pardon?!\r",
        "Ces Pokémon sont irremplaçables. Vous\n",
        "êtes sûr d’être prêt à vous en défaire?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_LucasThosePokemonAreCrucial",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Wha...?!\r",
        "Those Pokémon are crucial.\n",
        "You’re giving them away?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Quoi?!\r",
        "Ces Pokémon sont irremplaçables. Vous\n",
        "êtes sûr d’être prêt à vous en défaire?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_PeopleShouldMeetPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hm!\r",
        "We exist side by side with Pokémon.\r",
        "There comes a time when people should\n",
        "meet Pokémon.\r",
        "There is a world that should be\n",
        "explored together.\r",
        "For them, today is that time.\n",
        "The place, right here.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Hum!\r",
        "Nous coexistons avec les Pokémon.\r",
        "Tout le monde devrait en côtoyer à\n",
        "un moment ou à un autre.\r",
        "C’est une expérience propre à changer\n",
        "sa vision du monde.\r",
        "Le moment est venu pour ces enfants.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_GoOnChooseAPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Go on! Open the briefcase and choose\n",
        "a Pokémon!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Allez! Ouvrez la mallette et choisissez\n",
        "un Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_RowanGoOnChooseAPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Go on! Open the briefcase and\n",
        "choose a Pokémon!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Allez! Ouvrez la mallette et\n",
        "choisissez un Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ICantBelieveIt",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Really?!\n",
        "Prof. Rowan!\r",
        "I can’t believe it! I’m so happy now\n",
        "that I can’t keep a straight face!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Vraiment?!\n",
        "Professeur Sorbier!\r",
        "Je n’en crois pas mes oreilles! Je suis\n",
        "si heureux que j’ai du mal à me\f",
        "contenir!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_YouCanChooseFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "You can choose first.\r",
        "Hey, I’m practically a grown-up.\n",
        "I have to show some class here."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "Choisis en premier.\r",
        "Tu comprends, je suis presque adulte,\n",
        "alors je dois montrer l’exemple."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_PickAPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What’s up with you?\n",
        "Open the briefcase and pick a Pokémon!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Qu’est-ce que\n",
        "t’attends? Ouvre la mallette et fais\f",
        "ton choix!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ImPickingThisStarter",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Then, I choose you!\n",
        "I’m picking this {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: C’est toi que je choisis!\n",
        "Je prends ce {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_IHopeYoullDoWell",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Very well! Both of you have\n",
        "chosen a good Pokémon, it seems.\r",
        "Now, listen well!\r",
        "The Pokémon you have been entrusted\n",
        "with are unfamiliar with the world.\r",
        "In that regard, they’re much\n",
        "like you.\r",
        "As fellow newcomers to the world,\n",
        "I hope you’ll do well together.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Très bien! Vous avez choisi\n",
        "de bons Pokémon.\r",
        "A présent, écoutez-moi bien!\r",
        "Les Pokémon que je vous ai confiés ne\n",
        "connaissent pas encore le monde.\r",
        "En cela, ils vous ressemblent beaucoup.\r",
        "Vous avez tout à découvrir, j’espère\n",
        "que vous ferez de bonnes équipes.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ComeSeeMeInSandgemTown",
      "en_US": [
        "If you have any trouble, come see me\n",
        "at my lab in Sandgem Town.\r",
        "And now, we’ll be on our way.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "En cas de problème, n’hésitez pas\n",
        "à venir me voir dans mon labo de\f",
        "Littorella.\r",
        "Bien, à présent, partons.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_DawnWaitForMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Professor!\n",
        "Wait for me, please!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Professeur!\n",
        "Attendez-moi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_DawnPleaseLetMePass",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry...\n",
        "Please let me pass.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Veuillez m’excuser...\n",
        "Je dois y aller.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_LucasWaitForMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Professor!\n",
        "Wait for me!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Professeur!\n",
        "Attendez-moi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_LucasSorryFolks",
      "en_US": "Uh, sorry, folks.\r",
      "fr_FR": "Euh, désolé.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_ProfRowansReallyNice",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: How do you like that?\n",
        "Prof. Rowan’s really nice.\r",
        "On TV, he seems so stern and scary.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Qu’est-ce que tu dis de\n",
        "ça? Le Professeur Sorbier est très\f",
        "gentil.\r",
        "Rien à voir avec ce que je m’étais\n",
        "imaginé en le voyant à la télé.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_OnlyOneThingToDo",
      "en_US": [
        "Heheh, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "We’ve both got Pokémon now.\r",
        "There’s only one thing to do, right?\n",
        "Are you up for this?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hé, hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Maintenant, on a chacun un Pokémon.\r",
        "Il n’y a plus qu’une chose à faire, non?\n",
        "Tu te sens à la hauteur?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_DontBeThatWay",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What’s with that attitude?\n",
        "Don’t be that way!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Mais c’est quoi cette\n",
        "attitude? Reprends-toi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_Dummy6",
      "garbage": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_IChallengeYouToABattle",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I’ve always wanted to\n",
        "say this...\r",
        "The time has finally come!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "I challenge you to a battle!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: J’ai toujours rêvé de\n",
        "dire ça...\r",
        "L’heure a enfin sonné!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Je te défie en combat singulier!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_WhewLetsGoHome",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Whew!\n",
        "Let’s go home.\r",
        "I’m beat after that battle.\n",
        "My Pokémon needs rest, too.\r",
        "See ya, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Waouh!\n",
        "Rentrons à la maison.\r",
        "Ce combat m’a épuisé.\n",
        "Et mon Pokémon aussi a besoin de repos.\r",
        "A plus, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route201_Text_IWonLetsGoHome",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Aha...\n",
        "Ahaha... I won? I won!\r",
        "But that battle, it could’ve gone\n",
        "either way. It was that close!\r",
        "I can tell you one thing: battling is\n",
        "awesomely fun!\r",
        "OK, let’s go home.\r",
        "I’m beat after that battle.\n",
        "My Pokémon needs rest, too.\r",
        "See ya, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ah, ah...\n",
        "Ah, ah... J’ai gagné? J’ai gagné!\r",
        "Enfin, ça aurait pu finir différemment!\n",
        "C’était juste!\r",
